{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b8e23591e9d78360aebaedf9cc585858a9a96475ec1db8302c325df195ff1381",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0827763c66e08529a85a1d44175bdd1e4379ec780db570d3848433b4ec1c9bf",
      "text": "花音的生日快到了。\n期待着能得到大家祝福的花音，\n却完全看不到制作人和直央他们\n在筹备生日的迹象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a85345ddcef546c0055c9c4fcc4e6f5bcf7264d952e2d995f35a6056dc2fc235",
      "text": "（诶嘿嘿，马上就是花音的生日啦～！\n好兴奋♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54421c8befd1875a401c9bed1b7867ff1ad1bc52c9034666ae6c05caadadaf0a",
      "text": "（直央君和志狼君，还有制作人，\n今年肯定也一定会给我庆祝的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f061cae3b0824f7c3ecf2252eb74497e0bcc7cd908020cfe14e8e5cea0cc662b",
      "text": "（会有什么礼物呢，好期待呀。\n会不会有生日派对呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46456039dd6bad2b28d4b04095413115ddfeccb041d35635394eabfa30b60508",
      "text": "（呜～好想快点知道！\n不过，到生日为止要忍耐，忍耐）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0c4eed4de04e2f8d663e00685bc5986615177b8964b5b9b426578556ea37dce",
      "text": "各位，差不多该去练习室了。\n请准备一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d",
      "text": "好～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6397219d1f64128f1818738590705881fd2e4dc88d00e75be7ad3a139fa92471",
      "text": "今天的练习也是我要跳得\n最最最帅气的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9879431095b834ae22f3d34d27a29f7fefa053a6c32e108519172342895078",
      "text": "那个，志狼君。今天是要练歌哦。\n日期可能记错了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f008dd9451a59ddda3efd7f61409f6e3d9b05a451552020ee9b99b9364583318",
      "text": "我、我知道啦！\n我说的是自主练习啦，自主练习！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39a721081ffc99fc749fe9cf4f299c5f2e3ebb5515766148de3c8825ad6e460c",
      "text": "志狼君，今天还要留下来练习吗？\n时间没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d56226b97e6a647485dda302d333021730d7ec306864d41216fb7de88f2203",
      "text": "噢！今天我很闲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b820d94ae548a4b7cf48b41448683b223d4854e43f11dedc754874b0c5fdffa",
      "text": "（总觉得大家和平常一样……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83e057b8dbf34304dde8391c76c159d8546c6e51cbdcfc3e23a1d5e4ec97c9f",
      "text": "（但是，为了给花音一个惊喜，\n大家一定是在保密对吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f24f71fd19a27845bc43782ca069f0bf6e0ea37b0d5cab2a4851fac4ccc2e77",
      "text": "台词本读完了——！咦？\n制作人，工作还没做完吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a63ca901fac886c4f8993fc35f200ed8671908d0ed1b475db3150cd13c96d7a",
      "text": "好像还在忙呢。一直在打电话，\n一时半会儿好像还脱不开身。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5248c981f89701c5335edc2df3c1d92c179bbab92d21cf52a307166f3e55447",
      "text": "最近工作很多，稍微有点忙呢。\n不过能一直和大家在一起好开心呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea4698ba18d9a4066353cac4d48ac253b6c8da92f2d554eebec910ec080004c1",
      "text": "（虽然开心……但是。大家\n有在准备花音的生日吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2690bc540fccdeac49b26f84b65e601757ebeb32c7c4e272d971595cf7d0acd",
      "text": "（难道忘记了？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c304c79a6fb66437bc06f57578cc47814199b6ace4ec0230bd66bb12982d4a3",
      "text": "（……才不会。只是大家都很擅长瞒着而已吧！\n直央君的生日会也是秘密举行的嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6755aa95a81c7385da06a82adf9c46dbc001849d7aae2aa6a6e8daf1fa12d4",
      "text": "（不只是直央君，志狼君也是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f232b56fbdf55f1df52b73db7a8c4a0c795c124de81cc0f58c91000029211029",
      "text": "花音君，……没事吧？\n有哪里看不懂的地方吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2990564203a974562245b605051090e5e4b4bec355bcb24ddd265158135023b0",
      "text": "是这样吗？哪里不懂。\n要我来教你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ca915fef6e2c5eadce47b5a54996b73320f80f7ebcc01a0511751be43480a1c",
      "text": "啊，那个，没事的！……花音\n口渴了！去拿果汁过来哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e09207d0ba2d86a12bcf939831f77f9b65bafeb8431c85195ba7157eee585e38",
      "text": "（不行不行，和直央君他们一直待在一起的话，\n就会忍不住想问生日的事了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_b:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36c6619fd55beca5e4083ae9351cc25ca30a00cec95810b1f71637fc448f385",
      "text": "（接下来稍微一个人呆会儿吧。\n这样的话，就能忍住不问了对吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:266f35a25a8bd4331deb31ac9151e3cbfa7d02661f057cb6ca10af88189b8ed8",
      "text": "今天的练习大家配合得真默契呢。\n制作人给了我们点心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea91c721cbbc1f2e2093299a056ab1c312a845e01c8c143835386216e06eaf15",
      "text": "好嘞，开吃开吃！\n我要这个大巧克力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0b19d2736ab65a334dab9f29e15f36fd9f1a4e1d53f53e9f9af813faae6644c",
      "text": "……花音呢～现在有一本很想看的书。\n去那边自己看会儿书哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf63575b692013b21403070d9c8373ee4072ff94e61bc3b168234d7ac294ec85",
      "text": "诶！？哦、哦……？\n点心不吃了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:844eb2ba6545dd5ad4372fca94a4167b6a7b7bdf9cafec33735af1964ee27d24",
      "text": "等会儿吃！\n所以给花音留一份哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000084:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903c1b425bacda171af5ab5569c41beb3b93c8235d860d6173f537404a33bb66",
      "text": "又过了一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6144d9802d792148c26cab9fd70104e5a47871d559f8869dc08253ce6da99d30",
      "text": "拍摄辛苦了！\n休息之后就是采访。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b1644e5a9522603fef696df6641dccccaa8eb12e64aeb59d4fed2d45ae1c017",
      "text": "噢！\n拍摄还挺轻松搞定的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7d7d7a34ceca3ca17da134629cf9c111d4657604ea087e83d7fec0e09063716",
      "text": "我稍微有点紧张。……虽然每次都这样啦。\n花音君感觉怎么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9467852c37c3ae2a693d5109897225d8fd8b17e1af713243203b2a11adfecbd",
      "text": "啊，那边有个穿得很可爱衣服的孩子。\n我去问问是在哪里买的衣服哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8cf383dc5dd47c9ccb28e0cfb641d4abed800d4ee0b8bce242467e0c2583c05",
      "text": "啊，嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_c:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a656b7d2b2fb7d281eb4d23b4b57083477a17f3bcc69b50b84ec60e6070f6812",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62f03fcfec6385f90658119cc92f3010ba6899aa2dff7361e157479cfdf20b5a",
      "text": "怎么说呢，最近的花音总觉得坐立不安的啊。\n经常想一个人呆着，是发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d2ff25edaf5d11d797b8747948f2f5e3a3a30881433b9ee602edf4b7fb2417",
      "text": "（志狼君原来还没发现啊……\n制作人，该怎么办呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d049b9e0180c15adf987c02d38350cddabfc2a905def31c09cd6b9b6218f1f5",
      "text": "（先瞒着志狼君吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74983afef57a3d72922f4984963ff3fb518635450ec7df37bc367566fce8390a",
      "text": "也许只是那种心情吧。我偶尔\n也会想一个人呆着的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8215b3c647dd4369e8f6f1d5b12826844823f0d9d9d333c04db3f5d08d742402",
      "text": "对啦！花音不在正好。\n那个的事，还没定下来对吧，那个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ea785156c45bedbe50e7e883252900232561dfadaca8489d72594d2179ea76",
      "text": "是指花音君的生日蛋糕吧！\n这本册子里看中哪个了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0fd2a13ee7a5be09ec1538b1eee06c1714cbafdb6d4d8b97aca3ad04860607a",
      "text": "小兔子蛋糕怎么样？\n……比如这一页上登的这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3a554ef81104870d47e38034b5ef50b0cc0dc63a98b34a2f1b466dc06889214",
      "text": "大赞成——！\n那家伙超喜欢兔子，绝对会高兴疯的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe9707c6136bad3ba63db96994e03241d02bc70b76a705d5b35d87d4ef4f804",
      "text": "啊！祝福语巧克力牌，\n好像我们自己也能写呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d0fc6f10dc7f1a1ede095ea5a0239a5b0592e352151f20ed5f193ee84030ccd",
      "text": "呐，由我们来写好不好？\n写“花音生日快乐”这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39638a5ef5a7c93f9c5027a5d044f03b81b9f5df8182e1f089ae71e62acdca12",
      "text": "嗯，好主意。\n制作人也能帮忙写吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000123:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_d:cmd-000123:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bddfa2a142276eb36d3a1e7138d9c47bd162da90f58f3b854ee67c8c498d44d2",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85a11d8eb71231773dd83a69a4f4ba6a1fc04d2598119c0bc75d4bdaa8d631e7",
      "text": "花音君，祝你生日快乐。\n这是我们送的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a19cc6e02374db16f226b965fef355d67407a286214b6fee467fb1f7e9628f",
      "text": "生日快乐——！还有蛋糕呢！\n制作人快端出来啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb4975e246ab076c6212d0cd9ac9a05542975ac0425894506fd8faf6848cf0c",
      "text": "来啦！……花音君，\n祝你生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f94a5680aaeea7eb9474e2c9bfa5c4de03686748aba41f691ab684cf35afc22a",
      "text": "哇啊～！！\n好可爱，好厉害，是小兔子的蛋糕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb8c2f8d3e9704f104308dcaf95e6b558dfff2a629fd39cb159ee817d0bafd8",
      "text": "祝福语巧克力牌可是我们自己写的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72a5aaa303db1c90d7e8b5b1157848d0233138de14585913b5be794d8ab78f18",
      "text": "还画了小兔子！这个是志狼君，\n这个是直央君，这个是制作人对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53f6fa680609679942aeb6ed65edf18fc0362d1ee4ed7b7dd627186fb2442581",
      "text": "嗯。全部猜中了，花音君真厉害。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46f2303916fdf72cd4b40f7c20f8baf63be73e1536b3237fbcd5cbc3522909ac",
      "text": "呐呐，我可以拍下这个蛋糕的照片，\n拿给家人和粉丝们看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f970114efb6a879e4164c7d866ea3d176f0ed9b743d190b0a48e236c78efe6a",
      "text": "当然可以。难得的机会，\n要拍张纪念照吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4a1191166c79a4b984db721bc2787630ae67abdcda81e55471220edc27d177c",
      "text": "嗯，拜托啦！直央君、志狼君，\n再靠近一点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b68d5944f2e35c4734fb8ca25c581fad7cc1fab4c270599ceb4d99a98db5fb25",
      "text": "呐，我也想和制作人一起拍！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:015fe13e3974057e272b735a3a8b252df8f2a7fd35c3b2cef5b5704e8be23007",
      "text": "好的。\n那么拍完这张后，我们大家一起拍一张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b40c4e1d1057e44039e9a5ec8c4bca4231283aa49de34eda013d84a91e170e1",
      "text": "你们3个人，今天谢谢大家。\n这真是超～级美好的生日哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
